The '''Secretariat of Science and Innovation''' ({{lang-bl|Secretaria de Ciencias y Innovación}}), '''SECCyI''', is the [[Balisca|Baliscan]] [[Secretariat Council (Balisca)|secretariat]] for developing and implementing the government policy on {{W|Research|scientific research}}, {{W|R&D|technological development}} and {{W|innovation}} in all sectors. In particular, SECCyI is responsible for the exercise of research, technological development and innovation competencies in {{W|Space industry|space}} matters, including representation and participation in [[COCO]] and other international organizations. 

